BIRDS -- COMBINATORS, AFTER THE BIRDS OF SMULLYAN'S
TO MOCK A MOCKINGBIRD. HOWBIRDS SHOWS THEM ALL. A FUNCTION
IS GIVEN TO A BIRD BY NAME OR GLYPH, AS CHARACTERS, AND
EXECUTE CALLS IT: ANY FUNCTION, PRIMITIVE OR DEFINED.

   I X         IDIOT       X
   X K Y       KESTREL     X, IGNORING Y
   X KI Y      KITE        Y, IGNORING X: K GIVEN I
   X T F       THRUSH      F X
   FG B X      BLUEBIRD    F G X
   F C Y Z     CARDINAL    Z F Y
   F W X       WARBLER     X F X
   FG S X      STARLING    X F G X
   M F         MOCKINGBIRD F F
   F Y X       SAGE        THE FIXED POINT OF F, ON X

FG IS TWO FUNCTIONS, 'F G'. FSTEP, SHOUT AND HYP ARE THERE
TO BE GIVEN TO THE BIRDS. NOTHERE SAYS WHAT IS STILL MISSING.
